Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.92,0:02:14.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who was the first to find him?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.82,0:02:16.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could they please answer\Na few questions for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.78,0:02:17.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's the culprit?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.69,0:02:18.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are there any suspects?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.92,0:02:22.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there any connection between this and\Nthe annihilation of the Franky house?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.40,0:02:23.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the condition?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.31,0:02:24.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could you give us a statement, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.66,0:02:27.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, did you hear about what happened\Nat the shipbuilding island last night?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.78,0:02:29.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it true? Did he die?
Dialogue: 2,0:02:29.75,0:02:34.68,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\pos(965,756)\fscx148\fscy148\bord2.6\c&H0D0D0D&\3c&H0D0D0D&\1a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(400,500)\t(355,400,\1a&H00&)\t(4430,4475,\1a&HFF&)}Back Alley, Water Seven
Dialogue: 3,0:02:29.75,0:02:34.68,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\pos(965,756)\fscx148\fscy148\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(400,500)}Back Alley, Water Seven
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.80,0:02:30.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Franky did this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.78,0:02:31.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.69,0:02:34.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You let someone like that run around\Nfree and this is what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.50,0:02:35.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.41,0:02:36.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it might have been those\Npirates who've been
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.36,0:02:39.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hanging around the\Nshipyards the past few days.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:38.60,0:02:43.18,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\pos(944,637)\fscx150\fscy150\bord2.7\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(400,0)\t(355,400,\1a&H00&)}The Roof of an Inn\NBack Alley
Dialogue: 3,0:02:38.60,0:02:43.18,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\pos(944,637)\fscx150\fscy150\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(400,0)}The Roof of an Inn\NBack Alley
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.00,0:02:47.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this is where you've been.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.82,0:02:55.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We went through all the trouble of\Nrenting a room and no one's using it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.56,0:02:57.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess nobody could sleep, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.64,0:03:01.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And where's Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.32,0:03:03.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.18,0:03:10.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So where were you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.84,0:03:15.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I kept lookout around\Nthe rocky Cape all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.14,0:03:17.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted to be there in\Ncase Robin came back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.86,0:03:18.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.98,0:03:25.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she never said
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.48,0:03:26.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,anything about leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.56,0:03:28.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder where she went?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.30,0:03:36.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I'll try looking\Naround for her in town today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.98,0:03:40.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think we're going to find her?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.10,0:03:41.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.64,0:03:46.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not like I have any place\Nspecific in mind to check out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.16,0:03:49.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just feel certain that\Nshe's still here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.86,0:03:54.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If anything should happen, we should\Nuse this inn as our meet-up point.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.98,0:03:55.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.02,0:03:56.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to come too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.02,0:04:01.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, then come on, Nami, what's
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.96,0:04:05.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wrong. It's awful. The\Nwhole city's talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.02,0:04:12.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,about it Luffy listen to me last night\Nsomething terrible happened to Iceberg
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.06,0:04:20.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What Iceberg was shot in his home stop\Nscrewing around is this some kind of
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.72,0:04:25.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joke no joke is he alive who would do\Nsuch a thing everyone loves him he's
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.54,0:04:26.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.45,0:04:27.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Calm down, Polly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.37,0:04:29.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen to me for a second. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.50,0:04:31.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was discovered in his room
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.06,0:04:34.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,early this morning, lying\Nin a pool of his own blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.96,0:04:39.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like I said, he's alive, but he's\Nbeen unconscious since he was found.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.60,0:04:42.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need to come to the\Nmain office immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.24,0:04:50.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lulu, where's Polly?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.62,0:04:51.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just called him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.00,0:04:53.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll be here soon. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.66,0:04:54.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reporters are all over
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.58,0:04:56.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.49,0:04:58.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's mass hysteria out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.22,0:05:00.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are the ones who'd like\Nto know what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.76,0:05:04.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The office has been torn apart, but\Nthere's no trace of anything being stolen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.92,0:05:05.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No money,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.04,0:05:08.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,no valuables, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.58,0:05:12.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If this wasn't a robbery, then the\Nquestion is, who would try to kill
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.36,0:05:15.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Iceberg and why?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.58,0:05:18.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At any rate, we're in big trouble here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.30,0:05:19.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The city's in total panic.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.10,0:05:23.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If anything should happen to Iceberg,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.32,0:05:25.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then it's not only the end\Nfor the Galley-La Company,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.70,0:05:28.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but the entire city of Water 7 as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.00,0:05:43.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doctor, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.91,0:05:45.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is his condition?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.70,0:05:57.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was shot two times in the front,\Nand another three from behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.84,0:06:02.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no idea what happened in that\Nroom last night, but it was brutal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.06,0:06:06.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,According to forensics,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.66,0:06:08.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's no sign of the\Nlocks being picked to
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.48,0:06:11.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,his office or anywhere\Nelse in the building.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.18,0:06:14.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The incident occurred in a\Nroom no one could have entered.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.32,0:06:20.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only thing out of place they found was\Na mask you can buy just about anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.12,0:06:26.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ice pops from the shipyard?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.02,0:06:29.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I've heard he's still unconscious.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.72,0:06:34.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought everybody in this\Nentire city loved that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.08,0:06:34.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why him?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.06,0:06:36.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.90,0:06:39.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's the nice man that helped\Nus out so much yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.92,0:06:43.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The president of the shipbuilding\Ncompany as well as the mayor of Water 7.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.92,0:06:46.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds like an important guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.44,0:06:50.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's pretty much the worst thing\Nthat could have happened to this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.62,0:06:52.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll go check on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.34,0:06:59.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.26,0:07:00.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,note,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.17,0:07:01.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,let's go look for Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.09,0:07:01.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Chopper?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.00,0:07:04.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.84,0:07:11.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I think I'll just wait a\Nwhile, see how things turn out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.00,0:07:16.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Extra, extra, read all about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.48,0:07:20.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Iceberg, our beloved mayor\Nand the hero of Water 7,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.92,0:07:23.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,has fallen victim to the\Nhands of an assassin!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.80,0:07:26.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is an urgent news\Nreport covering the incident!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.00,0:07:27.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.91,0:07:28.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is Iceberg okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.83,0:07:29.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.80,0:07:31.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who would do such a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.40,0:07:34.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only pirates would pull a vicious\Nattack like that out of nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.56,0:07:35.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No doubt about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.62,0:07:37.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like to get my hands\Non the ones that did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.06,0:07:41.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There were a bunch of pirates\Nrampaging through Doc 1 just yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.60,0:07:43.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean the Mikazuki gang?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.60,0:07:48.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it sounds crazy, but I think\Nthe government did this. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.82,0:07:50.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.30,0:07:51.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm talking about Corgi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.54,0:07:56.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every time he comes to talk with\NIceberg, he gets rejected and leaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.92,0:07:59.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, Franky did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.40,0:08:03.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't really know what he's\Ntrying to speak with him about,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.14,0:08:05.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but he must have done this out of spite.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.06,0:08:07.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd keep that theory to myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.98,0:08:11.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you openly blame the world\Ngovernment, it won't be taken lightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.90,0:08:16.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this diabolical criminal's\Ngoal to gain wealth or power?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.12,0:08:20.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is this nameless assassin\Nthat disappeared without a trace?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.94,0:08:24.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who in the hell did this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.88,0:08:27.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna let him get away with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.28,0:08:33.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for writing this feature.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.72,0:08:36.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next stop, Station at War 7.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.38,0:08:38.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arighting momentarily.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.38,0:09:05.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.50,0:09:07.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A word, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.56,0:09:09.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can we get a comment about this incident?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.38,0:09:10.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What were you told before you came here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.98,0:09:12.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up, all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.24,0:09:13.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get the hell out of my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.16,0:09:16.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell us, what explanation were\Nyou given by your company?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.92,0:09:18.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polly, please, a comment.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.24,0:09:19.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have time for this crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.02,0:09:20.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.93,0:09:24.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you aware of any incident that can\Ncause someone to target Iceberg's life?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.36,0:09:25.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anything at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.27,0:09:26.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There must be something.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.52,0:09:28.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Any altercations with pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.86,0:09:30.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't you idiots hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.20,0:09:32.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.92,0:09:41.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I guess the rumors are true he was\Nattacked yeah so if we go to the shipyard it's
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.08,0:09:45.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,likely We won't be able to meet with him\Nthen let's just go to his house I believe
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.92,0:09:52.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he lives inside The main office kiwi mozu
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.18,0:09:58.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,am am I asleep is this a dream this is
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.40,0:10:02.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,no dream without a doubt this is was the\Nvery spot where the Franky house stood.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.06,0:10:07.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But something like this\Nhappening just seems so extreme.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.50,0:10:14.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.70,0:10:30.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who would be stupid enough to\Ndo something like this to my
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.98,0:10:37.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Household on I know who damn
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.84,0:10:40.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you Straw Hat Luffy so this
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.30,0:10:43.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is your payback for us stealing\Nyour 200 million berries
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.56,0:10:49.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,how dare you treat my faithful\Nmen this way it's so heartless
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.66,0:10:52.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unforgivable
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.82,0:10:56.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Franky, bro! You came back! Franky!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.48,0:10:58.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys are alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.20,0:11:00.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.46,0:11:01.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.40,0:11:05.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.70,0:11:08.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those pirates are completely insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.06,0:11:12.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, we've been keeping track\Nof what the Straw Hats are up to.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.70,0:11:16.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We know there's no way you're\Ngonna let them get away with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.30,0:11:18.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are they now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.36,0:11:20.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all going to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.20,0:11:24.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After that, they headed over\Nto the shipbuilding island.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.66,0:11:25.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Doc 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.00,0:11:26.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were there yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.02,0:11:28.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet that's where they're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.94,0:11:30.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.76,0:11:32.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.02,0:11:34.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.08,0:11:38.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I find you, I'm\Ngoing to rip you apart.
Dialogue: 2,0:11:40.43,0:11:45.35,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,556)\fscx150\fscy150\fsp2\bord2.7\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(400,0)\t(355,400,\1a&H00&)}Shift Station
Dialogue: 3,0:11:40.43,0:11:45.35,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,556)\fscx150\fscy150\fsp2\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(400,0)}Shift Station
Dialogue: 2,0:11:40.43,0:11:45.35,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,671)\fscx150\fscy150\fsp2\bord2.7\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(400,0)\t(355,400,\1a&H00&)}North of Water Seven
Dialogue: 3,0:11:40.43,0:11:45.35,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,671)\fscx150\fscy150\fsp2\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(400,0)}North of Water Seven
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.32,0:11:46.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.56,0:11:49.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Granny! Granny!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.90,0:11:51.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The wind is blowing like crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.58,0:11:57.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crazy wind!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.98,0:11:59.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crazy wind!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.98,0:12:02.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough already. Keep it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.96,0:12:07.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The southern wind, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.18,0:12:09.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Must be current.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.98,0:12:13.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The waves are getting rough, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.22,0:12:18.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if this keeps up, the sea\Ntrain won't be able to run tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.42,0:12:21.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Timmy, Conis, get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.44,0:12:22.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going back to the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.90,0:12:23.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.64,0:12:33.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aqua Laguna is coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.70,0:12:44.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your attention please.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.92,0:12:46.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your attention please.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.46,0:12:49.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the Water 7\NWeather Forecasting Center.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.50,0:12:50.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As of now,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.50,0:12:54.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,an Aqua Laguna severe weather warning has\Njust been issued for the entire island.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.92,0:12:59.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,its arrival time is estimated to be\Nsometime between midnight and 12 30.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.16,0:13:02.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,oh yeah i guess it Is about\Nthat time I've been preoccupied
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.72,0:13:06.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with what happened to iceberg\Nhey aqua laguna is coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.44,0:13:08.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make sure everybody\Nknows about the warning
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.52,0:13:12.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all right no more work\Nfor today what'd he say?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.10,0:13:14.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aqua Laguna.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.96,0:13:16.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.76,0:13:19.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that broadcast about just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.22,0:13:20.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.26,0:13:21.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody knows what...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.50,0:13:23.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, wait, are you a visitor here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.70,0:13:26.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, you've come sightseeing\Nat a really bad time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.38,0:13:29.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aqua Laguna is an annual storm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.54,0:13:31.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's about to pass through here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.40,0:13:32.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A storm, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.60,0:13:33.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A big one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.78,0:13:36.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going to need to\Nevacuate to higher ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.40,0:13:38.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This entire city will be underwater soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.66,0:13:40.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Underwater? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.90,0:13:42.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.12,0:13:44.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not going to happen\Nright this second.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.82,0:13:47.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,According to the forecast, it'll\Narrive sometime around midnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.76,0:13:50.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The locals have gotten used\Nto it, and you'll remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.64,0:13:51.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See ya! Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.72,0:13:55.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, the whole town will be...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.32,0:13:57.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, it's going to sink?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.60,0:13:59.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, apparently so.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.28,0:14:01.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to find Robin and Quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.10,0:14:01.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.44,0:14:03.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.35,0:14:04.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you tell us anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.36,0:14:05.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Iceberg!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.80,0:14:07.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.44,0:14:08.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.86,0:14:12.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't go that way, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.78,0:14:14.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're never gonna find out what's going on
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.70,0:14:17.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,unless we find some\Nway to get to ice pops.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.10,0:14:18.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.20,0:14:20.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you tell me where the\Nentrance of the main office is?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.68,0:14:22.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's head dock one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.16,0:14:23.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I don't think you're\Ngonna have any luck
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.00,0:14:26.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,getting in with everything\Nthat happened here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.32,0:14:28.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're only allowing authorized\Npersonnel to get through.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.86,0:14:29.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.06,0:14:31.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone wants in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.44,0:14:33.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're all so worried about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.12,0:14:33.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.03,0:14:34.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.18,0:14:41.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at all those people.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.42,0:14:43.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's all the commotion about?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.22,0:14:47.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, the bigger the audience,\Nthe better, I always say.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.24,0:14:56.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.36,0:14:57.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.64,0:15:02.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's that rhythm! What? Why\Nnow? Hey, guys! Question!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.60,0:15:04.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you just say my name?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.80,0:15:06.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, we didn't! Just go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.10,0:15:07.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.08,0:15:09.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's he coming from?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.68,0:15:10.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't see him!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.20,0:15:12.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, he's up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.74,0:15:16.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Ow! Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.86,0:15:17.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.56,0:15:19.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.94,0:15:21.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No need to be shy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.18,0:15:22.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say my name!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.42,0:15:24.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't want to! Get lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.60,0:15:27.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the one who attacked\NIceburg, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.22,0:15:28.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he has to be!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.08,0:15:29.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.14,0:15:31.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get the hell out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.34,0:15:33.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang that gunfight, not that punk!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.80,0:15:37.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a bunch of noisy flies.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.62,0:15:42.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm one of seven's number one super guy the\Nface of the underworld and you know why!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.12,0:15:44.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the man with the\Nplan the power and fame
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.44,0:15:47.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and people everywhere\Ncall out my name wow?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.94,0:15:48.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm!
Dialogue: 2,0:15:50.76,0:15:53.59,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,668)\fscx145\fscy145\fsp1\bord2.7\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(400,0)\t(355,400,\1a&H00&)}Franky\N{Head of the }Franky Family Boss\NDismantler and Bounty Hunter
Dialogue: 3,0:15:50.76,0:15:53.59,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,668)\fscx145\fscy145\fsp1\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(400,0)}Franky\N{Head of the }Franky Family Boss\NDismantler and Bounty Hunter
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.20,0:15:52.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Franky!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.98,0:16:04.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come out and show yourself, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.86,0:16:06.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop being such a pansy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.96,0:16:08.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out here and fight me already!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.32,0:16:11.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know how that\Nweirdo figured out my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.94,0:16:13.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen him before in my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.74,0:16:15.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't you hear what those people said?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.26,0:16:17.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think that guy might be Franky!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.54,0:16:19.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then we found him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.74,0:16:24.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's the one who beat up Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.40,0:16:27.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This money belongs to us now, understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.02,0:16:39.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.93,0:16:40.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.34,0:16:42.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.26,0:16:46.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It wasn't for him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.42,0:16:48.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.42,0:16:53.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.46,0:16:54.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bikini guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.70,0:16:55.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on a sec!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.32,0:17:04.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.56,0:17:05.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.66,0:17:08.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's still no information?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.72,0:17:10.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.80,0:17:11.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.26,0:17:16.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what's the word?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.34,0:17:25.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may enter, but try to keep your\Nvoices down, please. Then he...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.46,0:17:26.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he's okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.86,0:17:29.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His injuries are still serious, but Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.80,0:17:32.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Iceberg has finally\Nregained consciousness.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.00,0:17:35.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's great news!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.08,0:17:38.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's see how he's doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.42,0:17:41.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.18,0:17:45.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I've been better. I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.56,0:17:47.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All things considered,\Nyou're pretty lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.76,0:17:49.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, you just focus on getting better.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.96,0:17:53.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the meantime, you can count on us\Nto take care of the shipyard, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.90,0:17:54.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.64,0:17:59.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I need to talk to you about the\Npeople who broke into my room last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.60,0:18:00.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.51,0:18:02.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that's still under\Ninvestigation, I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.90,0:18:05.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I remember them. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.70,0:18:10.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There were two.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.16,0:18:15.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One of them was a large man who was\Nwearing a mask, and the other was a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.44,0:18:19.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tall, with long black hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.06,0:18:24.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could never forget those eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.14,0:18:26.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It has to be her.
Dialogue: 2,0:18:31.75,0:18:34.71,Sign-Reporters,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1051.5,411)\fscx147\fscy148\frz35.12\fry2\frx8\fax0.3\blur0.9}He regained consciousness
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.12,0:18:39.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe what I just heard. Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.32,0:18:40.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Iceberg's awake, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.84,0:18:43.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like our mayor's gonna be okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.18,0:18:44.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that true? All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.92,0:18:48.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew he'd make it! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.38,0:18:53.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're Luffy, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.76,0:18:57.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't expect you to look so shrimpy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.20,0:19:02.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got a bone to pick with you, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.24,0:19:04.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems you and your\Ngang had a little party at
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.94,0:19:07.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my place while I was gone\Nwhen I came home now?
Dialogue: 2,0:19:06.37,0:19:14.13,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\pos(972,658)\fscx145\fscy145\fsp1\bord2.5\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(400,400)\t(355,400,\1a&H00&)\t(7360,7405,\1a&HFF&)}Kiwi (Left) and Mozu (Right)\N{\fscx130\fscy130\fsp2}The Square Sisters\NThe Franky Family
Dialogue: 3,0:19:06.37,0:19:14.13,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\pos(972,658)\fscx145\fscy145\fsp1\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(400,400)}Kiwi (Left) and Mozu (Right)\N{\fscx130\fscy130\fsp2}The Square Sisters\NThe Franky Family
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.90,0:19:10.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did I see my house\Nis up to shreds and my
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.40,0:19:13.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,gang was on its knees and\Nit's all thanks to Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.16,0:19:18.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll make this as plain as can be when you\Nmess with my voice you mess with Franky!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.82,0:19:21.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd hate to be you right\Nnow cuz I'm on one hell
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.86,0:19:24.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of a roll this week and\Nain't nobody gonna stop me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.02,0:19:27.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you can cry if you\Nlike but either way!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.66,0:19:32.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna pound you so hard even your own\Nmother won't recognize you when I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.24,0:19:33.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.28,0:19:35.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.44,0:19:39.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give us our 200 million berries\Nback already! You hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.82,0:19:40.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.96,0:19:43.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want your money back, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.48,0:19:47.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that's a damn shame,\Nbecause I'm afraid I spent it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.22,0:19:50.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You pirates are all a\Nbunch of sore losers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.22,0:19:52.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't act all high and mighty when you
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.00,0:19:55.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,probably just stole the\Nmoney from someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.46,0:19:56.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The money doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.64,0:19:58.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe not to you, but it does to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.88,0:20:00.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I care about now is getting revenge,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.02,0:20:04.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So money or no money,\NI'm gonna make you pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.72,0:20:08.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're stealing my lines, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.42,0:20:10.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to make me mad?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.22,0:20:11.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.13,0:20:12.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just come down here and fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.28,0:20:14.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.20,0:20:15.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.24,0:20:19.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Frankie's going on a rampage! Come away!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.68,0:20:27.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he holding his breath or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.74,0:20:28.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.50,0:20:57.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He just spit fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.74,0:20:59.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I can see that much, but how?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.54,0:21:02.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh? You scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.16,0:21:04.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Having second thoughts?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.64,0:21:05.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.55,0:21:07.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he can do that, he might\Nhave Devil Fruit powers!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.90,0:21:09.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, but that doesn't really help!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.22,0:21:24.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that guy did eat a Devil Fruit, he\Nwouldn't just jump in the water for no reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.68,0:21:25.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would he?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.59,0:21:28.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe nobody told him that if\Nyou tried to swim, you'd die.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.46,0:21:29.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That'd be pretty pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.96,0:21:33.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but at least it would save us the\Ntrouble of fighting that weirdo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.24,0:21:49.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess he can't swim!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.46,0:21:50.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lucky didn't drown, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.30,0:21:54.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't eat no Devil Fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.54,0:21:55.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think I'm crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.46,0:21:59.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.10,0:22:02.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doesn't matter to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.28,0:22:04.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't surprise me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.94,0:22:07.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard about that little power of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.58,0:22:12.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stronger!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.44,0:22:22.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.46,0:22:29.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.52,0:22:45.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lupi!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.70,0:22:48.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.88,0:22:49.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.56,0:23:00.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't have Devil Fruit\Npowers, then what are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.06,0:23:01.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.97,0:23:04.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You poor saps don't know\Nanything now, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.62,0:23:06.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.92,0:23:07.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll humor you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.34,0:23:12.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just a normal guy\Nwith some extra parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.56,0:23:14.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A cyborg, you might say.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.76,0:23:26.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One of the Straw Hats did this?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.08,0:23:28.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.66,0:23:30.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of all people? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.14,0:23:33.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And my personal investigation\Nled to the same result.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.18,0:23:37.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To make sure I had Lucy, contact the\Ngovernment to confirm her identity and bounty.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.74,0:23:39.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.26,0:23:43.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They said she's a notorious criminal, so\Nit's no surprise that she'd do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.38,0:23:45.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Catastrophe to our boss! Cuckoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.66,0:23:55.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And our next course of\Naction is crystal clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.42,0:23:58.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We gotta find those rapscallions\Nand show them what's what.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.76,0:24:00.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What in the hell were they thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.66,0:24:03.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me they're pissed off\Nbecause we wouldn't fix their ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.40,0:24:04.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder that myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.82,0:24:07.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But regardless of what\Ntheir motivations might be,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.14,0:24:10.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the bottom line is that they're the\Nculprits and they need to be dealt with.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.44,0:24:11.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In other words,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.35,0:24:13.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we should just capture the\NStraw Hats and interrogate them
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.50,0:24:16.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ourselves instead of wasting time\Ntrying to figure this crap out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.74,0:24:18.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,None of this makes sense to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.44,0:24:22.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but anyone who messes with\NGalley-La is gonna have hell to pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.82,0:24:33.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey! There's trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.84,0:24:35.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up, Tile Stone!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.34,0:24:36.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're way the hell too loud!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.86,0:24:37.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.92,0:24:39.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just as loud as he is!
Dialogue: 1,0:24:39.95,0:24:45.08,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,692)\fscx140\fscy140\fsp1\bord2.6\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(400,0)\t(355,400,\1a&H00&)}Tilestone\NJoinery, Caulking, and Sailmaking Foreman\NDock One
Dialogue: 2,0:24:39.95,0:24:45.08,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,692)\fscx140\fscy140\fsp1\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(400,0)}Tilestone\NJoinery, Caulking, and Sailmaking Foreman\NDock One
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.38,0:24:41.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.29,0:24:42.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't know you were up already, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.02,0:24:44.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Iceberg! That's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.10,0:24:50.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He may be awake, but that doesn't\Nmean you should scream his ears off.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.64,0:24:52.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take it down a notch or two, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.14,0:24:53.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.05,0:24:55.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't help it! I swear!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.50,0:24:58.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I almost forgot!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.76,0:25:00.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had a turn or something!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.14,0:25:01.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine, but stay outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.78,0:25:03.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can tell me from over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.08,0:25:04.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got trouble with that Straw Hat guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.06,0:25:06.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what happened,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.16,0:25:10.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but he got in a big fight with Franky and\Nthey're both wrecking up the shipyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.10,0:25:12.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we don't stop them,\Nwho knows what they'll do?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.34,0:25:17.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat again?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.96,0:25:20.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But at least we know where to find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.10,0:25:24.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got some nerve.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.88,0:25:27.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll teach that punk to\Nshow his face on our turf.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.86,0:25:33.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you can finally have\Na bit of peace and quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.52,0:25:35.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let them take care of Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.48,0:25:38.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be watching over you in the meantime.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.52,0:25:40.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So there's no need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.16,0:25:48.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come, come.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.92,0:25:59.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch out, it's coming down!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.12,0:26:00.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It turns to the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.86,0:26:03.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it, go fight somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.16,0:26:05.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.36,0:26:11.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.38,0:26:14.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tear him to pieces and then\Nthey can put some pants on!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.30,0:26:15.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.72,0:26:17.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gotta put on a good show.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.42,0:26:27.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a lot tougher\Nthan I thought you'd be.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.88,0:26:30.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm still gonna beat you, bikini guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.88,0:26:33.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you say so,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.16,0:26:37.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now it's gonna take a long-ass time\Nwith those weenie attacks of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.42,0:26:49.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Weapons left!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.52,0:26:55.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.30,0:27:07.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't see.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.56,0:27:09.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems like they both got hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.84,0:27:11.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, look who it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.80,0:27:14.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who just punched me?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.76,0:27:21.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is too easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.24,0:27:25.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you knew what was good for you, you\Nwould have skipped town a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.42,0:27:26.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're in for it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.46,0:27:34.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Galley-La.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.74,0:27:36.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great, that's just what I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.70,0:27:39.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, the guys from\NDoc Ward finally made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.56,0:27:41.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lock those loosers up\Nand throw away the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.04,0:27:42.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.20,0:27:56.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right. The four men will\Ntake care of these guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.80,0:27:57.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was close.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.08,0:28:01.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they didn't show up, the whole\Nshipyard was gonna get totaled.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.44,0:28:02.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, lucky break.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.94,0:28:05.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finally, someone can put\Na stop to this nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.56,0:28:07.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet they hate Franky, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.68,0:28:09.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd butt out of this if I were you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.92,0:28:12.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once these fists start\Nrocking and rolling,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.40,0:28:15.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they don't discriminate between\Npirates and shipwrights.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.42,0:28:17.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that goes for other\Npeople's property, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.06,0:28:20.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surely you don't expect us\Nto stand here gobsmacked
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.78,0:28:22.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,while you wreck our entire shipyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.38,0:28:24.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm warning you, Franky!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.90,0:28:28.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't pay for these repairs\Nand berries, you'll pay in blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.14,0:28:29.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, Tile Stone, calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.96,0:28:32.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can take care of\NFranky some other time.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.88,0:28:36.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got more important\Nbusiness to deal with right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.70,0:28:39.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm looking at you, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.16,0:28:42.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know exactly what I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.32,0:28:45.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know if you're brave or\Nstupid, but either way, you're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.70,0:28:46.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.61,0:28:50.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just came here because we\Nheard the news about Ice Pops.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.00,0:28:53.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wasn't enough to wreck my\Nhouse and beat up my boys, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.02,0:28:54.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.93,0:28:57.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't feel like a man unless you're\Npounding the crap out of ship rights, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.76,0:29:00.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know the puberty can make\Nyou do some really crazy stuff,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.54,0:29:02.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but wow I don't even know what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.00,0:29:08.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So stop making fun of me. Play innocent,\Nall you like. I won't go easy on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.52,0:29:11.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Romance and Half-Nob!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.24,0:29:15.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.00,0:29:16.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.72,0:29:20.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Air drive!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.60,0:29:25.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dammit, just go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.38,0:29:27.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you shipwrights to\Nstay out of this, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.92,0:29:30.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who owes this\Nguy a beating, not you!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.62,0:29:37.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go Galley-La!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.84,0:29:39.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show them what you're made of!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.26,0:29:42.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way they can beat the\Ntop five shipwrights in the city!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.84,0:29:43.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.75,0:29:45.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are the shipwrights\Nfighting against us, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.84,0:29:47.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Makes me itchy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.32,0:29:51.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.76,0:29:54.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have any reason to fight you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.28,0:29:55.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.18,0:30:02.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.09,0:30:03.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got Devil Fruit power.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.34,0:30:16.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, stupid, are you even listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.80,0:30:19.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How many times do I\Nhave to tell you bozos?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.40,0:30:21.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.62,0:30:26.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat is mine, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.14,0:30:39.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Franky, but we don't have\Ntime for your shenanigans today.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.10,0:30:41.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get the hell out of my\Nway, you flying monkey!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.64,0:30:44.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the one who's in the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.98,0:30:49.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.98,0:30:51.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's our tile stone!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.40,0:30:53.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's even stronger than usual today!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.84,0:31:07.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cuckoo! Cuckoo! Cuckoo! Cuckoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.82,0:31:11.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.04,0:31:31.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, you guys are strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.36,0:31:34.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I still don't know why we're fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.36,0:31:44.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat, I think we're the ones who\Ndeserve an explanation here, not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.76,0:31:49.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone broke into\NIceberg's house last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.30,0:31:53.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shot him twice in the front and three\Ntimes in the back before they left.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.14,0:31:54.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were from your crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.78,0:31:56.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.46,0:31:58.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,None of us would do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.34,0:32:00.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm never gonna settle this, am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.14,0:32:24.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was Nico Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.34,0:32:27.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's not a single doubt in my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.20,0:32:31.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But was that masked man one\Nof the Straw Hats as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.20,0:32:34.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And why did they attack\Nme in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.56,0:32:37.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surely it wasn't about their ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.82,0:32:41.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, they must have been\Naiming to steal something.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.76,0:32:46.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But seeing as they left empty-handed, I\Nhave a good idea what they were looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.92,0:32:49.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The question is, if they were\Nworking with the government,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.90,0:32:52.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or if they want it for themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.74,0:32:54.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.42,0:32:56.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This just in!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.80,0:32:57.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Breaking news!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.56,0:33:02.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Iceberg has already identified the\Nculprits from the break-in last night!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.56,0:33:03.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.47,0:33:04.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.39,0:33:07.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spread the word through the city\Nand we'll capture them ourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.54,0:33:11.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't let those criminals\Nleave Water 7! Who did it?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.80,0:33:17.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show no mercy to the monsters\Nwho attacked our mayor!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.26,0:33:23.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Capture the Straw Hat Pirates\Nno matter what it takes!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.00,0:33:28.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Iceberg was shot?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.74,0:33:30.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's news to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.64,0:33:36.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dad, can't be! We.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.22,0:33:40.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.13,0:33:41.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We didn't shoot Iceburg.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.88,0:33:42.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's just crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.86,0:33:45.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There were two people who broke\Ninto his room and attacked him.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.98,0:33:47.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He may have been hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.54,0:33:50.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that doesn't mean he didn't\Nget a good look at him first.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.12,0:33:52.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One of them was a big guy with a mask on.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.44,0:33:56.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The other was a tall\Nwoman with black hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.56,0:33:59.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Iceberg told us he recognized her and the
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.92,0:34:02.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,government confirmed she's\Na member of your crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.08,0:34:06.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The archaeologist, Nico Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.06,0:34:09.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're lying!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.90,0:34:15.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't ask you why.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.80,0:34:19.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe your crew came to Water\N7 on a mission to kill Iceberg.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.54,0:34:22.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or maybe you really did\Nwant your ship repaired
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.10,0:34:25.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and attacked him on a whim\Nafter we turned you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.12,0:34:28.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know how you pirates\Nthink, and I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.14,0:34:33.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Point is, you tried to kill my boss,\Nand now I'm gonna have to take you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.90,0:34:35.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So he's one of the culprits?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.80,0:34:36.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tie him up, Polly!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.06,0:34:38.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let that pirate go!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.46,0:34:39.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.04,0:34:43.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So he got shot five times,\Nbut Iceberg's still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.00,0:34:45.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't look so surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.34,0:34:46.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That guy's as tough as nails.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.06,0:34:49.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if they tried it once,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.50,0:34:53.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then these scumbags might try to go\Nafter Iceberg a second time, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.84,0:34:56.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So we're gonna settle this now.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.82,0:35:04.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dead or alive, the world\Ngovernment doesn't care either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.70,0:35:07.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is what it means to\Nhave a bounty on your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.58,0:35:11.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Therefore, you can't complain, no\Nmatter how terrible your fate may be.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.42,0:35:16.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've broken the law, and now the\Nlaw has turned its back on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.30,0:35:18.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.70,0:35:21.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We chose to live this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.66,0:35:25.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're all outlaws, but I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.22,0:35:27.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.24,0:35:29.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you knew Robin, you wouldn't say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.60,0:35:30.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take that back!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.36,0:35:34.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, let me talk to Ice Pops.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.70,0:35:36.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This has to be a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.36,0:35:37.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way it was Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.06,0:35:40.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'd be fools to let\Nyou anywhere near him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.48,0:35:42.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Criminals have no right to make demands.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.38,0:35:44.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.52,0:35:45.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up the conference!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.44,0:35:49.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those bastards can't get\Naway with shooting our hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.70,0:35:51.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Send him to the gallows!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.30,0:35:53.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.58,0:35:55.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just calm down! Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.44,0:35:57.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.36,0:35:59.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't fool me, Missy!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.22,0:36:01.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I saw you with that Straw Hat guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.20,0:36:03.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet you're one of the\Ncriminals, aren't ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.80,0:36:05.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really? Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.40,0:36:08.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She was riding along with him\Non a yagra when he got here!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.44,0:36:09.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got you now!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.12,0:36:12.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna get what you deserve!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.84,0:36:14.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it! Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.56,0:36:16.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.54,0:36:19.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Word of this is going\Nto spread like wildfire.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.22,0:36:22.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no place to run\Nand no place to hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.52,0:36:24.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the end of the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.28,0:36:26.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You pirates are going down.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.96,0:36:29.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Extra, extra, read all about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.40,0:36:32.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hat Pirates were the\Nculprits in the attack against Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.60,0:36:33.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Iceberg.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.32,0:36:37.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Water Water newspaper\Nwill purchase any information
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.78,0:36:40.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,related to their current\Nlocation or actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.90,0:36:44.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We know that the culprits\Nare still here on the island,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.84,0:36:46.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so be sure to stay on the lookout!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.44,0:36:52.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We must band together to hunt down the\NStraw Hats and send them to the gallows!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.28,0:36:53.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!

